meta {
  name: Knowledge - List
  type: http
  seq: 43
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/:workspace/agents/:agent/knowledge
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  workspace: {{workspaceId}}
  agent: {{agentId}}
}

docs {
  Lists the `Knowledge Base` collections this agent uses and how, plus every
  shared collection in the workspace so a picker can offer what isn't
  attached yet. Requires `agent.view`.

  Each attached collection has a `mode`:
  - `search` — scopes the agent's `search_knowledge`/`read_knowledge_document`
    tools to it.
  - `always` — its hand-added documents are also put in the agent's prompt
    on every turn.

  `synced` collections (fed by a web page or connected app) can only be
  searched. `documents`/`characters` count hand-added documents only: what
  `always` would include. `always` reports how much of the
  `knowledge_base.max_injected_characters` budget is used and which
  documents don't fit and are left out.

  An agent with nothing attached searches every shared collection in the
  workspace.

  Response is wrapped: `{ ..., data: { attached, available, always } }`.
}
